# Partition (one pass, both halves) and the early-exit reductions, with a
# Part block so one parse answers two questions.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers

Part "1":
    Cursed Technique: Partition
        Using: (x) -> x % 3 = 0
    Cursed Technique: Take Item 0
    Maximum Technique: Sum By
        Using: (x) -> x * 2
    Reveal: stdout

Part "2":
    Maximum Technique: Find Index
        Using: (x) -> x = 424242
    Reveal: stdout
